<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>PCE 之前科技股抛售持续加剧；美国准备加征关税</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video</link><description>由于对人工智能交易前景的质疑增多，美国股指期货下跌，而美国国债在最新个人消费支出数据公布前上涨。中国称美国对其出口产品征收新关税的前景是“政治操纵”，并敦促双方维持贸易休战。汇丰银行 (HSBC) 的马克斯·凯特纳 (Max Kettner) 加入《彭博简报》讨论科技股抛售，并展望通胀数据。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video'&gt;PCE 之前科技股抛售持续加剧；美国准备加征关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tech Selloff Pesists Ahead of PCE; US Prepares Tariff Hikes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:28:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Swoon as AI Fears Spur Rush to Treasuries: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Rally as Tech Stock Losses Dent Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>为什么今年感恩节这么贵？</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year</link><description>计划你的感恩节杂货采购活动吗？您可能会注意到今年过道发生了一些变化。从消失的“免费火鸡”促销活动到牛奶价格上涨近 8%，迪娜·尚克 (Deena Shanker) 与马克斯·查夫金 (Max Chafkin) 共同探讨了感恩节晚餐的真正成本，以及目前杂货价格的推动因素。无论您在何处获取播客，都可以收听完整剧集。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year'&gt;为什么今年感恩节这么贵？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Why Is Thanksgiving So Expensive This Year?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:56:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps Below $3,500 on Rate Hike Outlook, AI Stocks Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>